A lot of things are getting skipped and changed here.
1- Wang Lin absorbed Xu Fenghan's materialization of his Dao inside his Underworld River. Xu Fenghan didn't store any items in bags of holding but stored them inside a folded space he created in the materialization of his Lotus Dao, there were some items inside. By the way, Xu Fenghan comes from planet Dong Lin (the planet Wang Lin wants to reach to revive Li Muwan).
2- Fragments of the Thunder Celestial Realm are linked by chains. Wang Lin doesn't walk in the void but walks on the chains and they follow the chains to find the secret fragment.
3- It doesn't make any sense for Wang Lin to be able to stop the restriction they find in the void. In the novel, that restriction was set by Master Flamespark which they also meet in the void. Master Flamespark had decided that Wang Lin and him are fated and he asks Wang Lin to give him his silver-horned Thunder Beast. In exchange, he helps Wang Lin's cultivation. After that he helps the trio to cross the void to reach the secret fragment.
He looked at Wang Lin and said, “Your cultivation is a mess. A thunder origin soul and a thunder body, what is this? Let this old man give you a helping hand!”
The old man’s right hand reached out and a large amount of dust gathered in his hand to form a ball of light. He then spat out a mouthful of energy into the ball of light and threw it without even looking. The ball of light shot directly toward Wang Lin.
The old man’s body flickered and then he disappeared with the Thunder Beast. However, almost right after he reappeared, he looked at where Wang Lin disappeared to and muttered, “Just then how much energy did I put into it? Uh… It seems I put a little too much… That little guy should be alright… Regardless, if he doesn’t die, then he really is fated with this old man.”
4- After that and during the following 20 chapters, Wang Lin is in constant agony trying to suppress the ball of light Master Flamespark gave him to prevent himself from dying on the spot.
His body trembled. This feeling was like when a mortal swallowed a piece of burning coal. Unimaginable heat was coming from inside his body as if it was trying to burn his entire body to dust.
5- In the novel, Li Yuan gives more details about his Ancestors. But the main change is that the donghua added the whole mind-control of the Ge Family subplot which is awesome and very fitting of Li Yuan.

